> perception: important) 'lojban' list functions primarily in a random
> natlang, ie English, and that people (me included) (legitimately or not)
> feel uncomfortable contributing in other random (nat)langs. I think that
> such a reminder is in itself valuable. ;)
>
> Med vendlig hilsen,
> iesk
